# libFuzzer scratch output -- raw console logs from ad hoc fuzzing runs
# (fuzz-0.log style, one per parallel worker) and each target's own crash-
# artifact directory. The harness sources under fuzz/*.cpp are real, tracked
# project content, and so is fuzz/corpus/*/ -- the seed corpus itself is
# tracked (see fuzz/README.md's own "Corpus" section: it should grow over
# time via -merge=1 minimization and those additions get committed, since
# they're exactly what keeps a payload that used to crash from ever
# regressing silently). Only the raw, disposable-by-nature output of
# actually running a fuzzer belongs in this list -- see docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
# ROADMAP item 2.
fuzz-*.log
fuzz/artifacts/
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
